      "targetText": "Positive square commutation on arbitrary real L²Fan Chen,Sinho Chewi,Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang supply Appendix D.1 spectral-calculus background. This ASTIS auxiliary real-L2 corollary uses pinned Mathlib CFC and local complexification;it is not a separately printed theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1;Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · PBPS2609.06905v1 Appendix D.1 spectral calculus background;ASTIS positive real-L2 square commutation corollary for B23/B21. · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)For every measurable space Ω and every measure μ,let G,D be bounded real linear operators on real L²(μ). Assume G,D positive:selfadjoint with nonnegative quadratic form. If G²D=DG²,then GD=DG. No probability,finite measure,finite-dimensional L²,nontriviality or caller CFC insta",
