      "targetText": "Same actual PBPS root and centered inverse commutationFan Chen,Sinho Chewi,Jianfeng Lu and Matthew S. Zhang;Appendix B3 spectral commutation used by B20/B23/B21. ASTIS explicitly constructs the actual centered restriction and real-L2 adapter;this ingredient is not the full energy theorem.arXiv:2609.06905v1;Lean4.33.0/fixedMathlib · PBPS2609.06905v1 Appendix B3: B20 corrector definition, Lemma B.3 sharp B23 estimate and B21 rotation. Same spectral square root, actual centered restriction and inverse commutation; ASTIS positive-square commutation background adapter. · faithful paraphraseComplete source statement (Samplinglib restatement)Let E be a finite-dimensional real Hilbert Borel space with canonical volume, including the explicit rank-zero extension. Let V:E→ℝ be C², 0<α≤β, and assume ",
